{
  "title": "Hemoglobin\u2013RDW interaction provides no demonstrated incremental DSST prediction across NHANES samples",
  "abstract": "In 1,290 NHANES 2011\u20132012 adults aged 60+ and 1,503 separately sampled 2013\u20132014 adults, adding a hemoglobin\u2013RDW interaction beyond flexible separate assays, hemoglobin/RDW ratio and covariates changed validation weighted MSE by -0.032472 score\u00b2 (-0.0202%). The source-refit/target PSU-bootstrap 95% interval was [-0.248576, 0.905069]. This does not demonstrate incremental predictive benefit or equivalence.",
